- Replaces the original CLIXML block with decoded text
- Preserves surrounding data (including trailing bytes on the same line)
- Handles parsing errors or incomplete CLIXML blocks by leaving the original 
data unchanged
- Handles CLIXML split across lines by leaving the original data unchanged

